t_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968\",\"uuid\":\"567aef37-dc40-4050-9bfb-cb394dd7f831\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:29.828Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh3t1ZP3JrStJBdK1RYQ\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh3t1qWT4zwhQFWPpoX5\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_019K9Cc12ue9KdEfVhoWpi4z\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174831__x898ed5/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":1118,\"limit\":100},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":6596,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":595437,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":6596},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968\",\"uuid\":\"b11834d9-4dc2-4166-81c5-7d8558210898\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:31.446Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh3t1ZP3JrStJBdK1RYQ\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_019K9Cc12ue9KdEfVhoWpi4z\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174831__x898ed5/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":1118,\"limit\":100}}}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_019K9Cc12ue9KdEfVhoWpi4z\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1118\\t---\\n1119\\t\\n1120\\t## 12. Art and animation\\n1121\\t\\n1122\\t### 12.1 The look target (from API.md: use every step)\\n1123\\t`res: 'ps1'` with `expand: true` (480×270 at 1080p, 427×240 at 1440p and 4K). Dressed HD characters 40–60 px tall\\n1124\\t(sizes 1.2–1.45; bosses 1.6–1.8). A backdrop behind the stands. A textured field and stands. 3–8 props on screen.\\n1125\\tEffects on every hit. Colors shaded with `E.tones`. Titles with `E.font.title`. Lights in every scene. Portraits in\\n1126\\tevery dialog. Compare screenshots with Metal Slug and Symphony of the Night, not NES games. `node tools/check.mjs`\\n1127\\tgives look notes: act on every one.\\n1128\\t\\n1129\\t### 12.2 Characters (`27-rigs.js`)\\n1130\\t**Rig recipes by position** (`new E.Humanoid({...})`, `weapon: null`, `sleeves: 'short'`, `outfit: 'shirt'`,\\n1131\\t`hat: { style: 'football', color, stripe, logo }` (E4)):\\n1132\\t\\n1133\\t| Position | build | size | Notes |\\n1134\\t|---|---|---|---|\\n1135\\t| OL, DL | bulky | 1.38–1.48 | `shoulderHalf` +0.6, `torsoW` +0.6, a lean of 0.1 |\\n1136\\t| LB | bulky or heroic | 1.3 | |\\n1137\\t| RB | heroic | 1.22 | stocky: `limbW` +0.3 |\\n1138\\t| WR, CB, S | heroic | 1.2 | lean: `limbW` −0.2 |\\n1139\\t| QB | heroic | 1.25 | |\\n1140\\t| K | heroic | 1.02 | the tiny kicker (a joke the announcer makes) |\\n1141\\t| Bosses: Bertha 1.6, The Mountain 1.7, Avalanche 1.8 | bulky | | Avalanche has a beard (gear hook) and `eyeGlow` off |\\n1142\\t| Refs | heroic | 1.15 | a cap (`hat: 'cap'`, white); stripes from the gear hook |\\n1143\\t| Coaches | bulky or heroic | 1.2 | a cap and a headset (gear hook), a polo |\\n1144\\t| Cheerleaders | heroic | 1.1 | `hair: 'ponytail'`, pom-poms (gear hook) |\\n1145\\t| Mascots | bulky | 1.3 | a costume head (gear hook), team colors |\\n1146\\t| Announcers (portraits only) | heroic | 1.2 | a headset, a blazer (`outfit: 'coat'`) |\\n1147\\t| Story cast (Mama Pearl, Sterling, ...) | per character | 1.2 | §18.1 |\\n1148\\t\\n1149\\t**The uniform from team colors:** `colors.cloth` is the jersey, `trim` the jersey trim (sleeve bands), `pants`,\\n1150\\t`belt`, `boot` the cleats, `glove` the gloves, the hat color the helmet. Away teams wear white jerseys with\\n1151\\tteam-color trim, and home teams wear their color. Skin tones (`#f0c8a8 #e0b090 #c89070 #a87050 #6a4028 #4a2c18`) and\\n1152\\thair styles vary per player (data). Faces show: `face: { eyes: 'big' }` on story cast, default on athletes, and eye\\n1153\\tblack on athletes (gear hook).\\n1154\\t\\n1155\\t**The gear hook (E3)** draws, depth-sorted inside the rig:\\n1156\\t- **Shoulder pads:** a wide disc over each shoulder joint in the jersey color, with a darker rim. They sit over the\\n1157\\t  torso, so the silhouette reads as football at a glance.\\n1158\\t- **The jersey number:** 3×5 digits (`font: 'tiny'`, scale by `u`) in the trim color, on the chest when the torso\\n1159\\t  faces the camera (`dot(facing, view.fx/fy) > .3`), on the back when it faces away (< −.3), hidden edge-on. Placed at\\n1160\\t  `Sp(J.shC, ±torsoDepth, 0, -3)`.\\n1161\\t- **The carried ball:** at the carrying hand, a brown ellipse with white laces (below), at the hand's depth + 0.02.\\n1162\\t  The sim sets `rig.carry = 'R' | 'L' | null`.\\n1163\\t- **Eye black,** a headset on coaches, pom-poms on cheerleaders (discs at the hands, team colors), ref stripes (black\\n1164\\t  vertical lines over the torso).\\n1165\\t- **Mascot heads:** a big disc 2.2× the head with features. Fumbles is a twig ball (brown line scribbles) with googly\\n1166\\t  eyes. Hambone is a pink hog with a snout and ears. Hooty is an owl with neon eyes (glow). Abominable Al is a white\\n1167\\t  fur ball with horns. Goldie is a gold lion with a mane.\\n1168\\t- **Big Heads cheat:** `rig.o.headR × 1.9` live. Check it re-solves; if not, rebuild the rigs.\\n1169\\t- **The Fiascos' glow paint** in LIGHTS OUT: the trims drawn with `px.glow(g, 1)` and an emissive queue.\\n1170\\t\\n1171\\t### 12.3 Pose codes to animation (`FF.Rigs.drive(rig, athlete, dt)`)\\n1172\\tThe sim sets `pose` and `poseU` (Appendix C). The presentation maps each to rig inputs, from four sources: the\\n1173\\tengine's procedural rig (velocity gait, `pose`, `expr`, `air`, `down`, `stance`, `run`, `flip`, `land`), `E.MOVES`\\n1174\\tand attack specs, mocap clips (§12.4), and PoseFX (§12.5).\\n1175\\t\\n1176\\t| Pose | Drive |\\n1177\\t|---|---|\\n1178\\t| IDLE, RUN | `rig.update(dt, { x, y, z, vx, vy, facing })`, the velocity gait; `sprint: true` with turbo |\\n1179\\t| STANCE3 (linemen) | mocap `Land_Three_Point` held at its last key (a hand on the ground), `mocapW` 1 |\\n1180\\t| STANCE2 (LB, WR, DB) | `pose: 'crouch'` blended 0.5, a lean of 0.25 |\\n1181\\t| QB_UC / QB_SG | `pose: 'crouch'` 0.35 with the hands forward (an attack spec held), or upright with the hands at the chest |\\n1182\\t| SNAP | a two-handed spec from low forward to between the legs, 0.25 s |\\n1183\\t| DROPBACK | the gait backward (verify the backpedal in a filmstrip; if it looks wrong, turn `facing` 25° off the motion) |\\n1184\\t| THROW | mocap `OverhandThrow`, `mocapMask: 'upper'` while moving (throwing on the run), time-scaled so the release lands on the sim's release frame |\\n1185\\t| HANDOFF give / take | specs: the arm extends / both arms form a pocket |\\n1186\\t| CARRY | the gait plus PoseFX `tuck` (the carrying hand to the chest side, the elbow in) |\\n1187\\t| CATCH_READY, CATCH | a two-handed spec reaching to the ball's height (`z1` from the arrival height); `air: true` with a jump |\\n1188\\t| DIVE, TACKLE_DIVE | PoseFX `tilt` forward 0→75° over 0.15 s, the arms forward (a two-handed `thrust`), `air: true`; on landing `down: 1` |\\n1189\\t| SPIN | `rig.spin` animated 0→2π over the action |\\n1190\\t| STIFFARM | the `jab` move with the free hand, held 70% of the action |\\n1191\\t| HURDLE | mocap `Run_Jump_Over`, time-scaled to the jump |\\n1192\\t| BLOCK | mocap `Push_Loop` (`mocapMask: 'upper'`) + a lean of 0.2; feet from the gait |\\n1193\\t| SHED / SWIM | `E.MOVES.hook` (an arm over) |\\n1194\\t| BIGHIT | `E.MOVES.bash` + PoseFX `tilt` 25° |\\n1195\\t| TACKLED | mocap `Fall_On_Face` (tackled from behind) or `Hit_Knockback` (from the front), then DOWN |\\n1196\\t| FLY (a Big Hit victim) | PoseFX `tilt` back 70° + `roll` spin (Mega Hit), `air: true`, then DOWN |\\n1197\\t| DOWN | `down: 1` |\\n1198\\t| GETUP | mocap `Get_Up_Face_Down` or `Get_Up_From_Back`, by how he fell |\\n1199\\t| PILE | `down: 1` + PoseFX random `tilt`/`roll` and a z offset (stacked) |\\n1200\\t| KICK | `E.MOVES.kick` after a 3-step run-up |\\n1201\\t| HOLD | `pose: 'kneel'` + a hand low forward |\\n1202\\t| CELEBRATE(k) | §10.6 |\\n1203\\t| CHEER | mocap `Cheering_Two_Hands` (teammates), `pose: 'cheer'` (refs and coaches) |\\n1204\\t| DEJECTED | `pose: 'kneel'`, or PoseFX `handsOnHelmet` |\\n1205\\t| REF_TD, REF_FD, REF_INC, REF_SHRUG | specs: both arms up, an arm pointing, arms crossing back and forth, a shrug |\\n1206\\t| CHEERLEADER | mocap `Jumping Jacks` and `Cheering_Two_Hands`, alternating |\\n1207\\t| COACH_YELL | `expr: 'shout'`, `pose: 'hips'`, the headset |\\n1208\\tFaces act: `expr: 'shout'` on hits and celebrations, `'wince'` when hurt, `'smile'` when Blazing. Enemy specials\\n1209\\ttelegraph with a 0.25–0.35 s wind-up and a flash.\\n1210\\t\\n1211\\t### 12.4 Motion clips (the FIASCO set)\\n1212\\tCut once, from the engine repository (§3.2):\\n1213\\t```sh\\n1214\\tnode tools/anim-set.mjs .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/quaternius.js .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/mesh2motion.js \\\\\\n1215\\t  .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/cmu.js \\\\\\n1216\\t  --clips \\\"QUATERNIUS:OverhandThrow,QUATERNIUS:Push_Loop,QUATERNIUS:Dance_Loop,Dance Charleston,Dance Body Roll,Victory Fist Pump,Cheering_Two_Hands,Breakdance_Helicopter,Run_Jump_Over,Dive_Roll,Fall_On_Face,Get_Up_Face_Down,Get_Up_From_Back,QUATERNIUS:Hit_Knockback,MESH2MOTION:Land_Three_Point,Jumping Jacks,Front_Kick,MESH2MOTION:Backflip\\\" \\\\\\n1217\\t  --name FIASCO --credit \\\"Quaternius (CC0), Mesh2Motion (CC0), CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (free for all uses)\\\" \\\\\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968\",\"uuid\":\"6596d6c7-0a51-4840-ae53-d3060ac1b46f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:31.451Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"file\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174831__x898ed5/work/PLAN.md\",\"content\":\"---\\n\\n## 12. Art and animation\\n\\n### 12.1 The look target (from API.md: use every step)\\n`res: 'ps1'` with `expand: true` (480×270 at 1080p, 427×240 at 1440p and 4K). Dressed HD characters 40–60 px tall\\n(sizes 1.2–1.45; bosses 1.6–1.8). A backdrop behind the stands. A textured field and stands. 3–8 props on screen.\\nEffects on every hit. Colors shaded with `E.tones`. Titles with `E.font.title`. Lights in every scene. Portraits in\\nevery dialog. Compare screenshots with Metal Slug and Symphony of the Night, not NES games. `node tools/check.mjs`\\ngives look notes: act on every one.\\n\\n### 12.2 Characters (`27-rigs.js`)\\n**Rig recipes by position** (`new E.Humanoid({...})`, `weapon: null`, `sleeves: 'short'`, `outfit: 'shirt'`,\\n`hat: { style: 'football', color, stripe, logo }` (E4)):\\n\\n| Position | build | size | Notes |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| OL, DL | bulky | 1.38–1.48 | `shoulderHalf` +0.6, `torsoW` +0.6, a lean of 0.1 |\\n| LB | bulky or heroic | 1.3 | |\\n| RB | heroic | 1.22 | stocky: `limbW` +0.3 |\\n| WR, CB, S | heroic | 1.2 | lean: `limbW` −0.2 |\\n| QB | heroic | 1.25 | |\\n| K | heroic | 1.02 | the tiny kicker (a joke the announcer makes) |\\n| Bosses: Bertha 1.6, The Mountain 1.7, Avalanche 1.8 | bulky | | Avalanche has a beard (gear hook) and `eyeGlow` off |\\n| Refs | heroic | 1.15 | a cap (`hat: 'cap'`, white); stripes from the gear hook |\\n| Coaches | bulky or heroic | 1.2 | a cap and a headset (gear hook), a polo |\\n| Cheerleaders | heroic | 1.1 | `hair: 'ponytail'`, pom-poms (gear hook) |\\n| Mascots | bulky | 1.3 | a costume head (gear hook), team colors |\\n| Announcers (portraits only) | heroic | 1.2 | a headset, a blazer (`outfit: 'coat'`) |\\n| Story cast (Mama Pearl, Sterling, ...) | per character | 1.2 | §18.1 |\\n\\n**The uniform from team colors:** `colors.cloth` is the jersey, `trim` the jersey trim (sleeve bands), `pants`,\\n`belt`, `boot` the cleats, `glove` the gloves, the hat color the helmet. Away teams wear white jerseys with\\nteam-color trim, and home teams wear their color. Skin tones (`#f0c8a8 #e0b090 #c89070 #a87050 #6a4028 #4a2c18`) and\\nhair styles vary per player (data). Faces show: `face: { eyes: 'big' }` on story cast, default on athletes, and eye\\nblack on athletes (gear hook).\\n\\n**The gear hook (E3)** draws, depth-sorted inside the rig:\\n- **Shoulder pads:** a wide disc over each shoulder joint in the jersey color, with a darker rim. They sit over the\\n  torso, so the silhouette reads as football at a glance.\\n- **The jersey number:** 3×5 digits (`font: 'tiny'`, scale by `u`) in the trim color, on the chest when the torso\\n  faces the camera (`dot(facing, view.fx/fy) > .3`), on the back when it faces away (< −.3), hidden edge-on. Placed at\\n  `Sp(J.shC, ±torsoDepth, 0, -3)`.\\n- **The carried ball:** at the carrying hand, a brown ellipse with white laces (below), at the hand's depth + 0.02.\\n  The sim sets `rig.carry = 'R' | 'L' | null`.\\n- **Eye black,** a headset on coaches, pom-poms on cheerleaders (discs at the hands, team colors), ref stripes (black\\n  vertical lines over the torso).\\n- **Mascot heads:** a big disc 2.2× the head with features. Fumbles is a twig ball (brown line scribbles) with googly\\n  eyes. Hambone is a pink hog with a snout and ears. Hooty is an owl with neon eyes (glow). Abominable Al is a white\\n  fur ball with horns. Goldie is a gold lion with a mane.\\n- **Big Heads cheat:** `rig.o.headR × 1.9` live. Check it re-solves; if not, rebuild the rigs.\\n- **The Fiascos' glow paint** in LIGHTS OUT: the trims drawn with `px.glow(g, 1)` and an emissive queue.\\n\\n### 12.3 Pose codes to animation (`FF.Rigs.drive(rig, athlete, dt)`)\\nThe sim sets `pose` and `poseU` (Appendix C). The presentation maps each to rig inputs, from four sources: the\\nengine's procedural rig (velocity gait, `pose`, `expr`, `air`, `down`, `stance`, `run`, `flip`, `land`), `E.MOVES`\\nand attack specs, mocap clips (§12.4), and PoseFX (§12.5).\\n\\n| Pose | Drive |\\n|---|---|\\n| IDLE, RUN | `rig.update(dt, { x, y, z, vx, vy, facing })`, the velocity gait; `sprint: true` with turbo |\\n| STANCE3 (linemen) | mocap `Land_Three_Point` held at its last key (a hand on the ground), `mocapW` 1 |\\n| STANCE2 (LB, WR, DB) | `pose: 'crouch'` blended 0.5, a lean of 0.25 |\\n| QB_UC / QB_SG | `pose: 'crouch'` 0.35 with the hands forward (an attack spec held), or upright with the hands at the chest |\\n| SNAP | a two-handed spec from low forward to between the legs, 0.25 s |\\n| DROPBACK | the gait backward (verify the backpedal in a filmstrip; if it looks wrong, turn `facing` 25° off the motion) |\\n| THROW | mocap `OverhandThrow`, `mocapMask: 'upper'` while moving (throwing on the run), time-scaled so the release lands on the sim's release frame |\\n| HANDOFF give / take | specs: the arm extends / both arms form a pocket |\\n| CARRY | the gait plus PoseFX `tuck` (the carrying hand to the chest side, the elbow in) |\\n| CATCH_READY, CATCH | a two-handed spec reaching to the ball's height (`z1` from the arrival height); `air: true` with a jump |\\n| DIVE, TACKLE_DIVE | PoseFX `tilt` forward 0→75° over 0.15 s, the arms forward (a two-handed `thrust`), `air: true`; on landing `down: 1` |\\n| SPIN | `rig.spin` animated 0→2π over the action |\\n| STIFFARM | the `jab` move with the free hand, held 70% of the action |\\n| HURDLE | mocap `Run_Jump_Over`, time-scaled to the jump |\\n| BLOCK | mocap `Push_Loop` (`mocapMask: 'upper'`) + a lean of 0.2; feet from the gait |\\n| SHED / SWIM | `E.MOVES.hook` (an arm over) |\\n| BIGHIT | `E.MOVES.bash` + PoseFX `tilt` 25° |\\n| TACKLED | mocap `Fall_On_Face` (tackled from behind) or `Hit_Knockback` (from the front), then DOWN |\\n| FLY (a Big Hit victim) | PoseFX `tilt` back 70° + `roll` spin (Mega Hit), `air: true`, then DOWN |\\n| DOWN | `down: 1` |\\n| GETUP | mocap `Get_Up_Face_Down` or `Get_Up_From_Back`, by how he fell |\\n| PILE | `down: 1` + PoseFX random `tilt`/`roll` and a z offset (stacked) |\\n| KICK | `E.MOVES.kick` after a 3-step run-up |\\n| HOLD | `pose: 'kneel'` + a hand low forward |\\n| CELEBRATE(k) | §10.6 |\\n| CHEER | mocap `Cheering_Two_Hands` (teammates), `pose: 'cheer'` (refs and coaches) |\\n| DEJECTED | `pose: 'kneel'`, or PoseFX `handsOnHelmet` |\\n| REF_TD, REF_FD, REF_INC, REF_SHRUG | specs: both arms up, an arm pointing, arms crossing back and forth, a shrug |\\n| CHEERLEADER | mocap `Jumping Jacks` and `Cheering_Two_Hands`, alternating |\\n| COACH_YELL | `expr: 'shout'`, `pose: 'hips'`, the headset |\\nFaces act: `expr: 'shout'` on hits and celebrations, `'wince'` when hurt, `'smile'` when Blazing. Enemy specials\\ntelegraph with a 0.25–0.35 s wind-up and a flash.\\n\\n### 12.4 Motion clips (the FIASCO set)\\nCut once, from the engine repository (§3.2):\\n```sh\\nnode tools/anim-set.mjs .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/quaternius.js .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/mesh2motion.js \\\\\\n  .cache/engine/src/mocap/sets/cmu.js \\\\\\n  --clips \\\"QUATERNIUS:OverhandThrow,QUATERNIUS:Push_Loop,QUATERNIUS:Dance_Loop,Dance Charleston,Dance Body Roll,Victory Fist Pump,Cheering_Two_Hands,Breakdance_Helicopter,Run_Jump_Over,Dive_Roll,Fall_On_Face,Get_Up_Face_Down,Get_Up_From_Back,QUATERNIUS:Hit_Knockback,MESH2MOTION:Land_Three_Point,Jumping Jacks,Front_Kick,MESH2MOTION:Backflip\\\" \\\\\\n  --name FIASCO --credit \\\"Quaternius (CC0), Mesh2Motion (CC0), CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (free for all uses)\\\" \\\\\",\"numLines\":100,\"startLine\":1118,\"totalLines\":2490}},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_019K9Cc12ue9KdEfVhoWpi4z\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":50,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968\",\"uuid\":\"66c8d146-4816-4e20-888c-a209b29770f7\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":509,"oldLines":3,"newStart":509,"newLines":7,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":290,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":90,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"381fdbd9-474d-4788-85e0-6d0e697e3637\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh3r3tjDGXhcAHwmgmB2\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":22889,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":324858,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":22889},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"c8274d1d-7698-4b8a-b1f8-84c35c9b9b1d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:02.800Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh3r3eLQKuMib37jhx3C\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":2519,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh3r3tjDGXhcAHwmgmB2\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now hits/glass, fights, BOOM/KABOOM, items/hazards, boss logic and the shootout.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":22889,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":324858,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":22889},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"95991d18-cc2a-4afb-a5c4-564344dbc2cd\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:02.801Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh3r3eLQKuMib37jhx3C\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh3r3tjDGXhcAHwmgmB2\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01V22Zk8hATJFTajj5HxwQjE\",\"name\":\"Write\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/27-hits.js\",\"content\":\"/* ---- Hits: checks, impulses, knockdowns, the glass, grudges (PLAN 7.7) ---- */\\nconst Hits = (() => {\\n  const mass = s => s.def.build === 'bulky' ? 1.35 : 1;\\n  function reset() {}\\n  /** a contact between a checking skater a and b at closing speed v (accidental: no check) */\\n  function contact(a, b, v, accidental) {\\n    if (accidental) { if (b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu')) return; knock(b, a, v * .8, false); Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(v), big: true, team: a.team, accidental: true }); return; }\\n    if (a.hitDone && a.hitDone[b.id]) return; if (a.hitDone) a.hitDone[b.id] = 1;\\n    if (b.state === 'deke' && b.stateT < .3 && RNG.sim() < .7 + .04 * (b.def.hnd - 3)) { Bus.emit('deke_dodge', { by: b.id, victim: a.id }); return; }\\n    let imp = T.checkPower * (v + 60) * (mass(a) / mass(b)) * Skater.hitMul(a.def) * (a.holdTurbo && a.turbo > 0 ? 1.45 : 1) * (M.kaboomT[a.team] > 0 ? 2 : 1) * (a.items.poutine > 0 ? 1.6 : 1) * (M.tactic && M.tactic[a.team] === 'grit' ? 1.1 : 1);\\n    if (b.twisterT > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 10);\\n    if (a.items.poutine > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 5);\\n    const unstoppable = b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu' && !M.attract);\\n    const p = M.puck, had = p.owner === b;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    if (imp < 90 || unstoppable) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .25; b.vx += nx * imp * .3; b.vy += ny * imp * .3;\\n      if (had && !unstoppable && !(b.items.tape > 0) && RNG.sim() < .5) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, bump: true, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 5);\\n    } else if (imp < T.knockdown) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .5; b.vx += nx * imp * .5; b.vy += ny * imp * .5;\\n      if (had && !(b.items.tape > 0)) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 10);\\n    } else {\\n      if (had) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      knock(b, a, imp, true);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: true, team: a.team, x: b.x, y: b.y });\\n      grudge(b, a, 35); for (const m of M.skaters) if (m.team === b.team && m !== b) grudge(m, a, 10);\\n      M.bigHitT = M.t; Replay.markClip('hit', imp);\\n      Items.hitOnIce(b, imp);\\n    }\\n    if (M.mascot && b === M.mascot) return;\\n  }\\n  function loose(b, a, nx, ny) { const p = M.puck; Skater.release(b, nx * 60 + b.vx * .5, ny * 60 + b.vy * .5, 0, 'loose'); p.lastTouch = a; p.touchT = M.t; M.stats[a.id].takeaways++; }\\n  function knock(b, a, imp, big) {\\n    b.state = 'down'; b.stateT = 0; b.downT = 1.4; b.shootHold = 0; b.winding = false;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    b.vx = nx * imp * .8 + a.vx * .3; b.vy = ny * imp * .8 + a.vy * .3; b.knockV = imp * .8;\\n    Rink.scuffAt(b.x, b.y, .2);\\n    if (M.puck.owner === b) Skater.release(b, nx * 60, ny * 60, 0, 'loose');\\n  }\\n  function grudge(victim, by, n) { victim.grudge[by.id] = Math.min(100, (victim.grudge[by.id] || 0) + n); victim.grudgeT = M.t; }\\n  /** a body into the boards: rattle, crack or shatter the glass (snowbanks bury) */\\n  function boards(s, vin, n, sp) {\\n    if (vin > 120) Bus.emit('rattle', { x: s.x, y: s.y, by: s.id, speed: vin });\\n    const pan = Rink.panelAt(s.x, s.y);\\n    if (s.state !== 'down' && s.state !== 'stun') return;\\n    if (M.arena.snowbank) { if (s.state === 'down' && vin > T.glassCrack * .8) { s.state = 'buried'; s.stateT = 0; Bus.emit('buried', { victim: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y }); } return; }\\n    s.rig.kick(-.4);\\n    if (vin > T.glassShatter || (pan.state === 'cracked' && vin > T.glassCrack)) breakPanel(pan, 'shattered', s);\\n    else if (vin > T.glassCrack && pan.state === 'ok') breakPanel(pan, 'cracked', s);\\n    if (vin > T.glassCrack) Replay.markClip('glass', vin + 60);\\n  }\\n  function breakPanel(pan, state, by) {\\n    if (!pan || pan.state === 'shattered' || M.arena.snowbank) return;\\n    if (state === 'cracked' && pan.state === 'cracked') state = 'shattered';\\n    pan.state = state; pan.shake = .5;\\n    Bus.emit('glass', { panel: pan.i, state, by: by ? by.id : null, team: by ? (M.teamOf(M.lastHitter || '') >= 0 ? M.teamOf(M.lastHitter) : 1 - by.team) : -1, x: pan.m[0], y: pan.m[1] });\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) M.lastHitter = e.by; });\\n  /** grudges cool off after 3 s of peace */\\n  function step(dt) { for (const s of M.skaters) if (M.t - (s.grudgeT || 0) > 3) for (const k in s.grudge) s.grudge[k] = Math.max(0, s.grudge[k] - 4 * dt); }\\n  return { reset, contact, boards, breakPanel, step, knock };\\n})();\\n\\n/* ---- Boom: one BOOM meter per team; at 100, KABOOM mode (PLAN 7.10) ---- */\\nconst Boom = (() => {\\n  const GAIN = { bighit: 18, check: 6, crack: 8, shatter: 15, fightWin: 45, fightLoss: 5, goal: 20, shotOnGoal: 4, save: 5, pass: 2, onetimer: 6, deke: 6, chirp: 3, boombox: 40, mascot: 10, flood: 30, organ: 30, turtleGain: 10, turtleLoss: -10, draw: 10 };\\n  function reset(m) { m.boom = [0, 0]; m.kaboomT = [0, 0]; }\\n  function add(team, n, why) {\\n    if (!M || team < 0 || team > 1) return;\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0 && n > 0) return;\\n    const k = n > 0 ? T.boomGain * (M.tactic && M.tactic[team] === 'grit' ? 1.15 : 1) : 1;\\n    M.boom[team] = clamp(M.boom[team] + n * k, 0, 100);\\n    if (M.boom[team] >= 100) start(team);\\n  }\\n  function start(team) {\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0) return;\\n    M.boom[team] = 0; M.kaboomT[team] = T.kaboomTime; M.kabooms[team]++;\\n    for (const s of M.skaters) if (s.team === team) s.turbo = 1;\\n    Bus.emit('kaboom_start', { team, gilded: TEAMS[team === 0 ? M.cfg.home : M.cfg.away].id === 'grizzlies' });\\n    Replay.markClip('kaboom', 300);\\n  }\\n  function end(team) { if (M.kaboomT[team] <= 0) return; M.kaboomT[team] = 0; Bus.emit('kaboom_end', { team }); }\\n  function step(dt) {\\n    for (const t of [0, 1]) if (M.kaboomT[t] > 0 && M.phase === 'play') { M.kaboomT[t] -= dt; if (M.kaboomT[t] <= 0) { M.kaboomT[t] = 1e-9; end(t); } }\\n    if (M.cheats.alwaysKaboom) for (const h of M.humans) if (M.kaboomT[h.team] <= 0 && M.phase === 'play') start(h.team);\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) add(e.team, e.big ? GAIN.bighit : e.bump ? 0 : GAIN.check); });\\n  Bus.on('glass', e => { if (M && e.team >= 0) add(e.team, e.state === 'shattered' ? GAIN.shatter : GAIN.crack); });\\n  Bus.on('goal', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.goal + (e.kind === 'onetimer' ? GAIN.onetimer : 0)); });\\n  Bus.on('shot', e => { if (M && e.onGoal) add(e.team, GAIN.shotOnGoal); });\\n  Bus.on('save', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.save); });\\n  Bus.on('pass_complete', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.pass); });\\n  Bus.on('deke_beat', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.deke); });\\n  Bus.on('chirp', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.chirp); });\\n  Bus.on('mascot_down', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.mascot); });\\n  Bus.on('fight_end', e => { if (!M) return; if (e.draw) { add(0, GAIN.draw); add(1, GAIN.draw); } else { add(e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightWin); add(1 - e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightLoss); } });\\n  Bus.on('turtle', e => { if (!M) return; add(e.team, GAIN.turtleLoss); add(1 - e.team, GAIN.turtleGain); });\\n  return { add, start, end, step, reset, GAIN };\\n})();\\n\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":22889,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":324858,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":22889},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"31823bc0-88a3-48a6-897b-58a16e608ed9\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:32.909Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh3r3eLQKuMib37jhx3C\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01V22Zk8hATJFTajj5HxwQjE\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/27-hits.js\",\"content\":\"/* ---- Hits: checks, impulses, knockdowns, the glass, grudges (PLAN 7.7) ---- */\\nconst Hits = (() => {\\n  const mass = s => s.def.build === 'bulky' ? 1.35 : 1;\\n  function reset() {}\\n  /** a contact between a checking skater a and b at closing speed v (accidental: no check) */\\n  function contact(a, b, v, accidental) {\\n    if (accidental) { if (b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu')) return; knock(b, a, v * .8, false); Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(v), big: true, team: a.team, accidental: true }); return; }\\n    if (a.hitDone && a.hitDone[b.id]) return; if (a.hitDone) a.hitDone[b.id] = 1;\\n    if (b.state === 'deke' && b.stateT < .3 && RNG.sim() < .7 + .04 * (b.def.hnd - 3)) { Bus.emit('deke_dodge', { by: b.id, victim: a.id }); return; }\\n    let imp = T.checkPower * (v + 60) * (mass(a) / mass(b)) * Skater.hitMul(a.def) * (a.holdTurbo && a.turbo > 0 ? 1.45 : 1) * (M.kaboomT[a.team] > 0 ? 2 : 1) * (a.items.poutine > 0 ? 1.6 : 1) * (M.tactic && M.tactic[a.team] === 'grit' ? 1.1 : 1);\\n    if (b.twisterT > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 10);\\n    if (a.items.poutine > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 5);\\n    const unstoppable = b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu' && !M.attract);\\n    const p = M.puck, had = p.owner === b;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    if (imp < 90 || unstoppable) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .25; b.vx += nx * imp * .3; b.vy += ny * imp * .3;\\n      if (had && !unstoppable && !(b.items.tape > 0) && RNG.sim() < .5) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, bump: true, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 5);\\n    } else if (imp < T.knockdown) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .5; b.vx += nx * imp * .5; b.vy += ny * imp * .5;\\n      if (had && !(b.items.tape > 0)) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 10);\\n    } else {\\n      if (had) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      knock(b, a, imp, true);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: true, team: a.team, x: b.x, y: b.y });\\n      grudge(b, a, 35); for (const m of M.skaters) if (m.team === b.team && m !== b) grudge(m, a, 10);\\n      M.bigHitT = M.t; Replay.markClip('hit', imp);\\n      Items.hitOnIce(b, imp);\\n    }\\n    if (M.mascot && b === M.mascot) return;\\n  }\\n  function loose(b, a, nx, ny) { const p = M.puck; Skater.release(b, nx * 60 + b.vx * .5, ny * 60 + b.vy * .5, 0, 'loose'); p.lastTouch = a; p.touchT = M.t; M.stats[a.id].takeaways++; }\\n  function knock(b, a, imp, big) {\\n    b.state = 'down'; b.stateT = 0; b.downT = 1.4; b.shootHold = 0; b.winding = false;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    b.vx = nx * imp * .8 + a.vx * .3; b.vy = ny * imp * .8 + a.vy * .3; b.knockV = imp * .8;\\n    Rink.scuffAt(b.x, b.y, .2);\\n    if (M.puck.owner === b) Skater.release(b, nx * 60, ny * 60, 0, 'loose');\\n  }\\n  function grudge(victim, by, n) { victim.grudge[by.id] = Math.min(100, (victim.grudge[by.id] || 0) + n); victim.grudgeT = M.t; }\\n  /** a body into the boards: rattle, crack or shatter the glass (snowbanks bury) */\\n  function boards(s, vin, n, sp) {\\n    if (vin > 120) Bus.emit('rattle', { x: s.x, y: s.y, by: s.id, speed: vin });\\n    const pan = Rink.panelAt(s.x, s.y);\\n    if (s.state !== 'down' && s.state !== 'stun') return;\\n    if (M.arena.snowbank) { if (s.state === 'down' && vin > T.glassCrack * .8) { s.state = 'buried'; s.stateT = 0; Bus.emit('buried', { victim: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y }); } return; }\\n    s.rig.kick(-.4);\\n    if (vin > T.glassShatter || (pan.state === 'cracked' && vin > T.glassCrack)) breakPanel(pan, 'shattered', s);\\n    else if (vin > T.glassCrack && pan.state === 'ok') breakPanel(pan, 'cracked', s);\\n    if (vin > T.glassCrack) Replay.markClip('glass', vin + 60);\\n  }\\n  function breakPanel(pan, state, by) {\\n    if (!pan || pan.state === 'shattered' || M.arena.snowbank) return;\\n    if (state === 'cracked' && pan.state === 'cracked') state = 'shattered';\\n    pan.state = state; pan.shake = .5;\\n    Bus.emit('glass', { panel: pan.i, state, by: by ? by.id : null, team: by ? (M.teamOf(M.lastHitter || '') >= 0 ? M.teamOf(M.lastHitter) : 1 - by.team) : -1, x: pan.m[0], y: pan.m[1] });\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) M.lastHitter = e.by; });\\n  /** grudges cool off after 3 s of peace */\\n  function step(dt) { for (const s of M.skaters) if (M.t - (s.grudgeT || 0) > 3) for (const k in s.grudge) s.grudge[k] = Math.max(0, s.grudge[k] - 4 * dt); }\\n  return { reset, contact, boards, breakPanel, step, knock };\\n})();\\n\\n/* ---- Boom: one BOOM meter per team; at 100, KABOOM mode (PLAN 7.10) ---- */\\nconst Boom = (() => {\\n  const GAIN = { bighit: 18, check: 6, crack: 8, shatter: 15, fightWin: 45, fightLoss: 5, goal: 20, shotOnGoal: 4, save: 5, pass: 2, onetimer: 6, deke: 6, chirp: 3, boombox: 40, mascot: 10, flood: 30, organ: 30, turtleGain: 10, turtleLoss: -10, draw: 10 };\\n  function reset(m) { m.boom = [0, 0]; m.kaboomT = [0, 0]; }\\n  function add(team, n, why) {\\n    if (!M || team < 0 || team > 1) return;\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0 && n > 0) return;\\n    const k = n > 0 ? T.boomGain * (M.tactic && M.tactic[team] === 'grit' ? 1.15 : 1) : 1;\\n    M.boom[team] = clamp(M.boom[team] + n * k, 0, 100);\\n    if (M.boom[team] >= 100) start(team);\\n  }\\n  function start(team) {\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0) return;\\n    M.boom[team] = 0; M.kaboomT[team] = T.kaboomTime; M.kabooms[team]++;\\n    for (const s of M.skaters) if (s.team === team) s.turbo = 1;\\n    Bus.emit('kaboom_start', { team, gilded: TEAMS[team === 0 ? M.cfg.home : M.cfg.away].id === 'grizzlies' });\\n    Replay.markClip('kaboom', 300);\\n  }\\n  function end(team) { if (M.kaboomT[team] <= 0) return; M.kaboomT[team] = 0; Bus.emit('kaboom_end', { team }); }\\n  function step(dt) {\\n    for (const t of [0, 1]) if (M.kaboomT[t] > 0 && M.phase === 'play') { M.kaboomT[t] -= dt; if (M.kaboomT[t] <= 0) { M.kaboomT[t] = 1e-9; end(t); } }\\n    if (M.cheats.alwaysKaboom) for (const h of M.humans) if (M.kaboomT[h.team] <= 0 && M.phase === 'play') start(h.team);\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) add(e.team, e.big ? GAIN.bighit : e.bump ? 0 : GAIN.check); });\\n  Bus.on('glass', e => { if (M && e.team >= 0) add(e.team, e.state === 'shattered' ? GAIN.shatter : GAIN.crack); });\\n  Bus.on('goal', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.goal + (e.kind === 'onetimer' ? GAIN.onetimer : 0)); });\\n  Bus.on('shot', e => { if (M && e.onGoal) add(e.team, GAIN.shotOnGoal); });\\n  Bus.on('save', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.save); });\\n  Bus.on('pass_complete', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.pass); });\\n  Bus.on('deke_beat', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.deke); });\\n  Bus.on('chirp', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.chirp); });\\n  Bus.on('mascot_down', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.mascot); });\\n  Bus.on('fight_end', e => { if (!M) return; if (e.draw) { add(0, GAIN.draw); add(1, GAIN.draw); } else { add(e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightWin); add(1 - e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightLoss); } });\\n  Bus.on('turtle', e => { if (!M) return; add(e.team, GAIN.turtleLoss); add(1 - e.team, GAIN.turtleGain); });\\n  return { add, start, end, step, reset, GAIN };\\n})();\\n\"}}}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01V22Zk8hATJFTajj5HxwQjE\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/27-hits.js (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"c9b7e3a8-d3f5-4a66-8934-24ee6a9aff68\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:51:32.920Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"create\",\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/27-hits.js\",\"content\":\"/* ---- Hits: checks, impulses, knockdowns, the glass, grudges (PLAN 7.7) ---- */\\nconst Hits = (() => {\\n  const mass = s => s.def.build === 'bulky' ? 1.35 : 1;\\n  function reset() {}\\n  /** a contact between a checking skater a and b at closing speed v (accidental: no check) */\\n  function contact(a, b, v, accidental) {\\n    if (accidental) { if (b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu')) return; knock(b, a, v * .8, false); Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(v), big: true, team: a.team, accidental: true }); return; }\\n    if (a.hitDone && a.hitDone[b.id]) return; if (a.hitDone) a.hitDone[b.id] = 1;\\n    if (b.state === 'deke' && b.stateT < .3 && RNG.sim() < .7 + .04 * (b.def.hnd - 3)) { Bus.emit('deke_dodge', { by: b.id, victim: a.id }); return; }\\n    let imp = T.checkPower * (v + 60) * (mass(a) / mass(b)) * Skater.hitMul(a.def) * (a.holdTurbo && a.turbo > 0 ? 1.45 : 1) * (M.kaboomT[a.team] > 0 ? 2 : 1) * (a.items.poutine > 0 ? 1.6 : 1) * (M.tactic && M.tactic[a.team] === 'grit' ? 1.1 : 1);\\n    if (b.twisterT > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 10);\\n    if (a.items.poutine > 0) imp = Math.max(imp, T.knockdown + 5);\\n    const unstoppable = b.items.poutine > 0 || (M.cheats.god && b.ctrl !== 'cpu' && !M.attract);\\n    const p = M.puck, had = p.owner === b;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    if (imp < 90 || unstoppable) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .25; b.vx += nx * imp * .3; b.vy += ny * imp * .3;\\n      if (had && !unstoppable && !(b.items.tape > 0) && RNG.sim() < .5) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, bump: true, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 5);\\n    } else if (imp < T.knockdown) {\\n      b.state = 'stun'; b.stateT = 0; b.stunT = .5; b.vx += nx * imp * .5; b.vy += ny * imp * .5;\\n      if (had && !(b.items.tape > 0)) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: false, team: a.team });\\n      grudge(b, a, 10);\\n    } else {\\n      if (had) loose(b, a, nx, ny);\\n      knock(b, a, imp, true);\\n      Bus.emit('hit', { by: a.id, victim: b.id, power: Math.round(imp), big: true, team: a.team, x: b.x, y: b.y });\\n      grudge(b, a, 35); for (const m of M.skaters) if (m.team === b.team && m !== b) grudge(m, a, 10);\\n      M.bigHitT = M.t; Replay.markClip('hit', imp);\\n      Items.hitOnIce(b, imp);\\n    }\\n    if (M.mascot && b === M.mascot) return;\\n  }\\n  function loose(b, a, nx, ny) { const p = M.puck; Skater.release(b, nx * 60 + b.vx * .5, ny * 60 + b.vy * .5, 0, 'loose'); p.lastTouch = a; p.touchT = M.t; M.stats[a.id].takeaways++; }\\n  function knock(b, a, imp, big) {\\n    b.state = 'down'; b.stateT = 0; b.downT = 1.4; b.shootHold = 0; b.winding = false;\\n    const nx = (b.x - a.x) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1), ny = (b.y - a.y) / (Math.hypot(b.x - a.x, b.y - a.y) || 1);\\n    b.vx = nx * imp * .8 + a.vx * .3; b.vy = ny * imp * .8 + a.vy * .3; b.knockV = imp * .8;\\n    Rink.scuffAt(b.x, b.y, .2);\\n    if (M.puck.owner === b) Skater.release(b, nx * 60, ny * 60, 0, 'loose');\\n  }\\n  function grudge(victim, by, n) { victim.grudge[by.id] = Math.min(100, (victim.grudge[by.id] || 0) + n); victim.grudgeT = M.t; }\\n  /** a body into the boards: rattle, crack or shatter the glass (snowbanks bury) */\\n  function boards(s, vin, n, sp) {\\n    if (vin > 120) Bus.emit('rattle', { x: s.x, y: s.y, by: s.id, speed: vin });\\n    const pan = Rink.panelAt(s.x, s.y);\\n    if (s.state !== 'down' && s.state !== 'stun') return;\\n    if (M.arena.snowbank) { if (s.state === 'down' && vin > T.glassCrack * .8) { s.state = 'buried'; s.stateT = 0; Bus.emit('buried', { victim: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y }); } return; }\\n    s.rig.kick(-.4);\\n    if (vin > T.glassShatter || (pan.state === 'cracked' && vin > T.glassCrack)) breakPanel(pan, 'shattered', s);\\n    else if (vin > T.glassCrack && pan.state === 'ok') breakPanel(pan, 'cracked', s);\\n    if (vin > T.glassCrack) Replay.markClip('glass', vin + 60);\\n  }\\n  function breakPanel(pan, state, by) {\\n    if (!pan || pan.state === 'shattered' || M.arena.snowbank) return;\\n    if (state === 'cracked' && pan.state === 'cracked') state = 'shattered';\\n    pan.state = state; pan.shake = .5;\\n    Bus.emit('glass', { panel: pan.i, state, by: by ? by.id : null, team: by ? (M.teamOf(M.lastHitter || '') >= 0 ? M.teamOf(M.lastHitter) : 1 - by.team) : -1, x: pan.m[0], y: pan.m[1] });\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) M.lastHitter = e.by; });\\n  /** grudges cool off after 3 s of peace */\\n  function step(dt) { for (const s of M.skaters) if (M.t - (s.grudgeT || 0) > 3) for (const k in s.grudge) s.grudge[k] = Math.max(0, s.grudge[k] - 4 * dt); }\\n  return { reset, contact, boards, breakPanel, step, knock };\\n})();\\n\\n/* ---- Boom: one BOOM meter per team; at 100, KABOOM mode (PLAN 7.10) ---- */\\nconst Boom = (() => {\\n  const GAIN = { bighit: 18, check: 6, crack: 8, shatter: 15, fightWin: 45, fightLoss: 5, goal: 20, shotOnGoal: 4, save: 5, pass: 2, onetimer: 6, deke: 6, chirp: 3, boombox: 40, mascot: 10, flood: 30, organ: 30, turtleGain: 10, turtleLoss: -10, draw: 10 };\\n  function reset(m) { m.boom = [0, 0]; m.kaboomT = [0, 0]; }\\n  function add(team, n, why) {\\n    if (!M || team < 0 || team > 1) return;\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0 && n > 0) return;\\n    const k = n > 0 ? T.boomGain * (M.tactic && M.tactic[team] === 'grit' ? 1.15 : 1) : 1;\\n    M.boom[team] = clamp(M.boom[team] + n * k, 0, 100);\\n    if (M.boom[team] >= 100) start(team);\\n  }\\n  function start(team) {\\n    if (M.kaboomT[team] > 0) return;\\n    M.boom[team] = 0; M.kaboomT[team] = T.kaboomTime; M.kabooms[team]++;\\n    for (const s of M.skaters) if (s.team === team) s.turbo = 1;\\n    Bus.emit('kaboom_start', { team, gilded: TEAMS[team === 0 ? M.cfg.home : M.cfg.away].id === 'grizzlies' });\\n    Replay.markClip('kaboom', 300);\\n  }\\n  function end(team) { if (M.kaboomT[team] <= 0) return; M.kaboomT[team] = 0; Bus.emit('kaboom_end', { team }); }\\n  function step(dt) {\\n    for (const t of [0, 1]) if (M.kaboomT[t] > 0 && M.phase === 'play') { M.kaboomT[t] -= dt; if (M.kaboomT[t] <= 0) { M.kaboomT[t] = 1e-9; end(t); } }\\n    if (M.cheats.alwaysKaboom) for (const h of M.humans) if (M.kaboomT[h.team] <= 0 && M.phase === 'play') start(h.team);\\n  }\\n  Bus.on('hit', e => { if (M) add(e.team, e.big ? GAIN.bighit : e.bump ? 0 : GAIN.check); });\\n  Bus.on('glass', e => { if (M && e.team >= 0) add(e.team, e.state === 'shattered' ? GAIN.shatter : GAIN.crack); });\\n  Bus.on('goal', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.goal + (e.kind === 'onetimer' ? GAIN.onetimer : 0)); });\\n  Bus.on('shot', e => { if (M && e.onGoal) add(e.team, GAIN.shotOnGoal); });\\n  Bus.on('save', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.save); });\\n  Bus.on('pass_complete', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.pass); });\\n  Bus.on('deke_beat', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.deke); });\\n  Bus.on('chirp', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.chirp); });\\n  Bus.on('mascot_down', e => { if (M) add(e.team, GAIN.mascot); });\\n  Bus.on('fight_end', e => { if (!M) return; if (e.draw) { add(0, GAIN.draw); add(1, GAIN.draw); } else { add(e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightWin); add(1 - e.winnerTeam, GAIN.fightLoss); } });\\n  Bus.on('turtle', e => { if (!M) return; add(e.team, GAIN.turtleLoss); add(1 - e.team, GAIN.turtleGain); });\\n  return { add, start, end, step, reset, GAIN };\\n})();\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[],\"originalFile\":null,\"userModified\":false},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01V22Zk8hATJFTajj5HxwQjE\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}","+{\"type\":\"rate_limit_event\",\"rate_limit_info\":{\"status\":\"allowed\",\"resetsAt\":1793793600,\"rateLimitType\":\"seven_day\",\"overageStatus\":\"rejected\",\"overageDisabledReason\":\"org_level_disabled\",\"isUsingOverage\":false,\"unifiedWindows\":{\"seven_day\":{\"utilization\":0.47,\"resetsAt\":1793793600,\"status\":\"allowed\"}}},\"uuid\":\"0956a058-fa25-49bb-b4fc-52d4563c6f81\",\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":50,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610\",\"uuid\":\"5cbb0b52-683d-40f1-aa0d-732c19d7c8e6\"}"]}]}],"moreFiles":17,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-184947__xa320fb/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185013__xe162c9/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174758__x42640e/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174831__x898ed5/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/27-hits.js","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183420__xf7f297/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183848__x1295cd/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-184648__xa320fb/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183153__xf5fb84/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-185046__x53986f/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xh